UUID: 7af072a0-dd17-3094-b0f0-e10659604b4c
This dataset includes the shares of different technologies of the DB production mix in Germany .
Location: Germany
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: GWh
Sampling: Statistics 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7af072a0-dd17-3094-b0f0-e10659604b4c.xml</text>
